# wo-library Cursor Rules

Follow `.ai/instructions.md` and the active plan in `docs/plans/v3-plan.md` (plan wins on conflict).

- Named exports only; TypeScript strict; no `any`
- Utilities: `@wo-library/js` (pure) and `@wo-library/web` (browser)
- UI/hooks for apps: `packages/registry` (copy-paste / shadcn), not a published React package
- No CSS Modules or atomic-design trees
- Number formatting uses `en-IN`
- Use `lodash-es`, never `lodash`
- Never push to `main` unless the owner asks in this session
